        "body": "Accenture plc is a public company headquartered in Dublin, Ireland, traded under the ticker ACN, according to the company's registration details. On its own website, Accenture describes itself as embracing change to create what it calls 360 degree value and shared success for clients, people, shareholders, partners and communities, and says it works across industries and around the world using emerging technologies and human ingenuity.\n\nThe site highlights Accenture Construct, described as a new global business that brings together advisory, engineering, delivery, digital and AI to orchestrate capital projects from strategy through execution and operation. Other material on the site addresses AI themes: redesigning work and skills so people and AI work together, the strain AI places on power demand and how data center developers are responding, and cyber resilience in what the company calls an AI driven threat landscape. The site also states that Accenture helps the European Commission's Directorate-General for International Partnerships scale AI across global operations.\n\nThe company's profile lists no tracked AI products, no MCP servers, and no lawsuits. Its registration record lists a CIK of 0001467373 and the alias ACCENTURE PLC-CL A.",
